>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-cheetah.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Quick escape · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">A Weekend in the Mara</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>3 days · 2 nights</b></span>
        <span>Maasai Mara · Fly-in</span>
        <span>Resident rates available</span>
        <span>from <b>$1,490</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=A%20Weekend%20in%20the%20Mara" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Quick escapes</a> / A Weekend in the Mara</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Already in East Africa? Trade the city for the plains for a single, glorious weekend. Fly into the Maasai Mara on Friday, spend two unhurried nights in big-cat country, and be home by Sunday evening — refreshed and full of stories.</p>
        <p>Designed for residents and short-stay travellers, with smooth fly-in logistics and special resident rates. Easily extended to a third night.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your weekend</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Fri</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to the Mara</h3><p>A late-morning flight from Nairobi's Wilson Airport drifts you over the Rift Valley to a Mara airstrip in about 45 minutes. Settle into camp, then an afternoon game drive and sundowners as the light turns gold.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mara tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sat</div><div class="day__body"><h3>A full day on the plains</h3><p>A dawn drive in search of lions and cheetah, an optional hot-air balloon with champagne bush breakfast, and an afternoon drive — with a Maasai village visit if you wish.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mara tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sun</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Morning drive &amp; fly home</h3><p>One last sunrise drive and a leisurely brunch, then a midday flight back to Nairobi — home in time for Sunday evening.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Return flights (Wilson ⇄ Maasai Mara)</li>
          <li>Two nights at a hand-picked tented camp</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Shared or private game drives</li>
          <li>All park &amp; conservancy fees</li>
          <li>Airstrip transfers</li>
          <li>Drinking water on safari</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$1,490 per person sharing</strong>; <strong>special resident rates available</strong>. The optional hot-air balloon safari is extra. Easily extended to a third night. Great year-round; July–October for the migration.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Escape this weekend.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and whether you qualify for resident rates, and we'll set it up.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=A%20Weekend%20in%20the%20Mara" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More escapes</p><h2 class="section__title">Other quick escapes</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="swahili-coast-escape.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-lamu.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Swahili Coast Escape</h3><p>3 days · the Indian Ocean.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="gorillas-in-a-weekend.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/rw-volcanoes.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Gorillas in a Weekend</h3><p>3 days · fly-in trek.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="kenya.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Kenya journeys</h3><p>Browse every Kenya itinerary.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
